# @hub-lanes

# ── UTILIZATION-QUIET LANE (BH-4012, BH-3988.4) ─────────────────────────────
# Daily at 07:20Z. For every fleet.conf project, reads the last 72h of hourly
# utilization snapshots (GET /api/utilization?project=&since=) and the prior
# week's merges (GET /api/metrics/dora), and raises one warn
# util-went-quiet-<project> when the project had free slots and no ready work
# the whole window after shipping the week before. One line per run in
# logs/utilization-quiet.log. Off: flags/lane-off-utilization-quiet
# (bin/harness-ctl.sh off utilization-quiet) or UTIL_QUIET_ENABLED=0.
20 7 * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/utilization-quiet.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
